        "HLURB-DHSUD Guidelines on New Towns and Planned Unit Development: Site selection and market demand checks precede final development assumptions. Locator: PUD Guidelines refined markdown lines 35-37, 457-460, 519-543, 612-640, 833-847, 1019-1106, and 1324-1356",
